      "title": "Cisco and Applied Materials, Thursday after the close.",
      "body": "The next AI-infrastructure test after Wednesday's rebound, with Nebius before the open and Cerebras after the close the same day. Polymarket gives Applied Materials about an 88% chance of beating its $4.13 EPS estimate. Morgan Stanley cut Cisco to Equal Weight going in."
